ational security community\u2019s most pressing challenges. Focused originally on restraining proliferation of nuclear arms and reducing defense overhead, BENS today leverages the diverse expertise of its membership to additionally support government efforts in tackling other prominent challenges such as cybersecurity and domestic terrorism. BENS for nearly four decades has been a trusted partner whose work has built a more effective and efficient military, saved billions in taxpayer dollars, and improved operations that protect our homeland.", "website": "http://www.bens.org/", "parent_id": null, "primary_ext": "Org", "updated_at": "2025-08-12T10:52:12Z", "start_date": "1982-00-00", "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "1494006", "connected_category_id": 1, "aliases": ["BENS", "Business Executives for National Security", "Business Executives for National Security, Inc."], "types": ["Organization", "Membership Organization", "Other Not-for-Profit"], "extensions": {"Org": {"name": "Business Executives for National Security", "name_nick": null, "employees": null, "revenue": null, "fedspending_id": null, "lda_registrant_id": null}}, "tags": []}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis.org/entities/40964-Business_Executives_for_National_Security,_Inc."}}, {"type": "entities", "id": 33331, "attributes": {"id": 33331, "name": "Goodwill Industries International", "blurb": "Large charity providing education, training, and career services", "summary": null, "website": null, "parent_id": null, "primary_ext": "Org", "updated_at": "2021-07-31T03:17:51Z", "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "90578", "connected_category_id": 1, "aliases": ["Goodwill Industries International"], "types": ["Organization", "Philanthropy"], "extensions": {"Org": {"name": "Goodwill Industries International", "name_nick": null, "employees": null, "revenue": null, "fedspending_id": null, "lda_registrant_id": null}}, "tags": []}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis